 str."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"str, ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Pointer to the found character in str, or a null pointer if no such character is found."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"find","note":"finds the first occurrence of the given substring"},{"label":"strchr","note":"finds the first occurrence of a character"},{"label":"wcsrchr","note":"finds the last occurrence of a wide character in a wide string"},{"label":"wcspbrk","note":"finds the first location of any wide character in one wide string, in another wide string"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":230,"codeBlockCount":2}
